  "answer": "In **Level IV — Proposed Services and Compensation**, LACERS evaluates the proposed services and fees using these criteria:\n\n| Criterion | Weight |\n|---|---:|\n| Professionalism of the RFP response | 15% |\n| Proposed scope of services and methodology | 30% |\n| Qualifications, experience, and accomplishments | 35% |\n| Value of cost | 20% |\n| **Total** | **100%** |\n\nThe cost criterion considers the **relative cost and value** of the proposed fee, including qualitative considerations—not necessarily price alone. Source: *LACERS 2025 Actuarial Consulting Services RFP*, pp. 14–15.",
